                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Like most people who use this platform, I own WAY too many games I've never played. to combat this, I added all my games to a wheel and gave them as long as I could. Here is my take for this game:\r\nCute little puzzle game where each level adds a new gimmick. Perfectly playable in short bursts if you don't have anything else to your disposable. Would go crazy on a flight. 4/10",
